U5 Zig target-constant build cost and payload
=============================================

Each block empties the cache directory, links a trivial C program with the
exact flags packages/toolchain-zig/src/index.ts builds for that target,
then repeats the compile and link against the now warm cache. Two trials
for each target on each host. The compressed figures are of the whole
cache directory; the macOS host has no zstd, so it reports gzip -6.

--- macOS host: ssh macbook-air, Apple Silicon, macOS 27.0, zig 0.16.0 ---
ZIG_GLOBAL_CACHE_DIR was a probe directory under ~/Desktop/u5-zig-const.
Nothing was committed or pushed in the macOS project checkout.

zig 0.16.0, host arm64 macOS 27.0
== trial 1 target macos-aarch64 flags: -target aarch64-macos -fsanitize=address,undefined -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic
  cold compile -c: 0.07s
  cold link:       4.20s
    cache 49MiB 823f
  warm compile:    0.04s
  warm link:       0.06s
    tar|gzip -6 bytes: 19982810
